# rust.config: kernel Rust support (CONFIG_RUST) on top of the HY320/HY200 defconfig, nothing else changed. Needs the
# pinned Rust toolchain of the build container (docs/build-container.md, "Rust for the kernel"); without it kconfig
# leaves CONFIG_RUSTC_VERSION=0, RUST_IS_AVAILABLE unset, and build.sh stops because CONFIG_RUST=y did not take.
# The defconfig already meets CONFIG_RUST's other conditions (no MODVERSIONS, RANDSTRUCT, DEBUG_INFO_BTF, CFI, KASAN).
# Developer fragment: KERNEL_CONFIG=rust build.sh kernel; the linkage pattern for C+Rust modules is docs/kernel-rust.md.
CONFIG_RUST=y
